 {'cn8':'10019120','previous_fail_reason':'Common wheat or meslin presented as partial common-wheat scope.','resolution':'GROUP_LEVEL customs entity CN-10019120. Common-wheat is a scope candidate only; no whole-CN common-wheat volume and no constituent allocation.','commercial_entity_id':'CN-10019120','botanical':None,'status':'RESOLVED_MODEL_ONLY'},
 {'cn8':'12091000','previous_fail_reason':'Sugar-beet crop type inherited vegetable category from Beta vulgaris biological link.','resolution':'Keep sugar-beet customs crop-type evidence at CN-12091000 with Beta vulgaris PARTIAL_SCOPE; category UNALLOCATED_COMMERCIAL_SCOPE. Do not invent an eleventh category or pretend vegetable usage.','commercial_entity_id':'CN-12091000','botanical':'Beta vulgaris','status':'RESOLVED_BY_WITHHOLDING_CATEGORY'},
